# clang-format configuration for bpe.
# Requires clang-format >= 20 (BinPackParameters: OnePerLine).
# Format everything: clang-format -i src/*.{h,cpp} tests/*.cpp examples/coordinator/*.{h,cpp}
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
Standard: c++17

# Layout
ColumnLimit: 120
## Namespaces
NamespaceIndentation: All
